OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe strong
OL,6,Fwinds and showers will ease to bring a
OL,7,Fsettled night, though the odd light
OL,8,Fshower may linger. Winds will ease to
OL,9,Fa light breeze and it will feel chilly
OL,10,Fin single-digit temperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FTomorrow will see a bright
OL,13,Fmorning, but becoming increasingly
OL,14,Fmild and grey. Patchy rain arrives
OL,15,Fwith a brisk breeze in the southwest
OL,16,Fbut most eastern areas will remain dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
